  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Naoyatiira Irrigation Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KARMA is a registered CBO, of which the Naoyatiira Self-Help group is a member. Grant funds will be used to place thirty acres of the Naoyatiira farm under center-pivot irrigation, allowing farmers to grow a combination of subsistence and cash crops.</narrative>
  </description>
